From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shayne <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:36:36 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: apple-sftl: Encode and verify native context pages

Pad complete native map batches, account for the whole logical map and
retain the original user age when relocating ordinary data. Reconstruct
per-block age summaries from native footer runs. Separate healthy donor
finalization from the later refresh of cached statistics.

Prebuild the planned checkpoint before any copy and program the verified
alternate context in whole pages with independent readback.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Shayne Legault <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Link: https://github.com/OrchardLinux/orchard/pull/226#issuecomment-7133476475
